<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.1">
<l>mātavattōṉ puttiraṉpōy maṟikaṭalvāy māṇṭāṉai</l>
<l>yotuvitta takkaṇaiyā vuruvuruvēko ṭuttāṉūr</l>
<l>tōtavattit tūymaṟaiyōr tuṟaipaṭiyat tuḷumpiyeṅkum</l>
<l>pōtilvaitta tēṉcoriyum puṉalaraṅka meṉpatuvē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of him who gave the son of the ascetic</l>
<l rend="indent">who had died after entering the swelling sea</l>
<l>his true form as a teaching gift</l>
<l>is called Araṅkam,</l>
<l rend="indent">with waters that pour forth honey contained in flower buds</l>
<l rend="indent">that, when men of the pure Vedas [with] clean vestments</l>
<l rend="indent">bathe in the river, overflows in every direction.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
